# Copy to .env.local and fill in. .env.local is gitignored; never commit a key.
#
# Verify your setup with:  npm run gemini:doctor

# Turns on real receipt reading and the grounded coach. Without it the app
# still runs — receipts fall back to a demo parse, the coach to its built-in
# heuristic — so this is optional, just better.
#
# Get one at https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
EXPO_PUBLIC_GEMINI_API_KEY=

# Optional. Only set this if `npm run gemini:doctor` says the default model id
# has moved on; it prints the ids your key can actually reach.
# EXPO_PUBLIC_GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-2.5-flash

# Optional. Points the app at a real backend instead of the in-memory mock.
# See src/data/http/httpApi.ts for the endpoints a server has to serve.
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=
